BT 1 0 0 1 0 37.4 Tm /F1 8.6 Tf 11.5 TL (The project demonstrates how an Incident UI Policy and three client script types can guide data entry, set urgency for high-impact) Tj T* (Incidents, prevent selected incomplete submissions, and block list-based State edits. The supplied screenshots document the) Tj T* (configuration and selected interactions. Before operational adoption, the team should confirm mandatory-field intent, retest all) Tj T* (paths in the target instance, and add server-side validation where the rules must apply beyond the form.) Tj T* ET
