BT 1 0 0 1 0 71.9 Tm 11.5 TL /F1 8.6 Tf .156863 .192157 .239216 rg (function onChange\(control, oldValue, newValue, isLoading\) {) Tj  T* (if \(isLoading || newValue == ''\) return;) Tj  T* (if \(newValue == '1'\) {) Tj  T* (g_form.setValue\('urgency', '1'\);) Tj  T* (g_form.addInfoMessage\('Urgency set to High for High impact incident.'\);) Tj  T* (}) Tj  T* (}) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
