Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.84 259.36 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 94.9 Tm 11.5 TL /F1 8.6 Tf .156863 .192157 .239216 rg (function onSubmit\(\) {) Tj  T* (if \(g_form.getValue\('impact'\) == '1' &) Tj (&) Tj  T* (g_form.getValue\('assigned_to'\) == ''\) {) Tj  T* (g_form.showErrorBox\('assigned_to',) Tj  T* ('Assigned To is mandatory for High impact incidents.'\);) Tj  T* (return false;) Tj  T* (}) Tj  T* (return true;) Tj  T* (}) Tj T* ET
Q
